Written by hand for this repository on 2026-11-18 (CC0 1.0: no rights
reserved): a two-port LC low-pass for ngspice's S-parameter analysis (.sp).
V1, port 1 (Sim.Params "dc=0 ac=1 portnum=1 z0=50"), on the net "p1"; L1,
100 nH, from "p1" to "p2"; C1, 40 pF, from "p2" to ground (the label "0");
V2, port 2 ("dc=0 ac=0 portnum=2 z0=50"), on "p2". KiCad writes each port
source's "portnum" and "z0" into the netlist, as its simulator does. The
sheet's directive is ".sp dec 10 1meg 1g". The source symbol is ours, the
inductor's and capacitor's definitions follow KiCad's Device:L and Device:C;
every connection is a label on a pin's end. For
tests/e2e/lo/sim-faults.spec.ts. files.json lists the files the e2e harness
opens. The KiCad files carry no comment, so this file holds their license.
